sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as HoloLens 2 Client<br/>(REST API)
    participant API as Django REST API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/PostGIS
    participant Signal as Django Signal<br/>(post_save)
    participant Redis as Redis Channel Layer
    participant Consumer as ASGI Consumer
    participant WS as HoloLens 2 Client<br/>(WebSocket)

    Client->>API: PUT /api/buildings/{id}/<br/>(JSON payload + JWT)
    API->>DB: UPDATE building SET ...
    DB-->>API: OK (row updated)
    API-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK
    
    Note over DB,Signal: Django post_save signal fires
    DB--)Signal: post_save(instance)
    Signal->>Signal: _serialize_building(instance)
    Signal->>Redis: group_send("buildings_08417008",<br/>{"type":"building_updated","data":{...}})
    
    Note over Redis,Consumer: Redis pub/sub fan-out
    Redis->>Consumer: Deliver to all group subscribers
    Consumer->>WS: send_json({"type":"building_updated",<br/>"data":{...}})
    
    Note over WS: ~200-500ms total latency
    WS->>WS: ParseSingleBuilding(data)
    WS->>WS: Update buildingDataCache
    WS->>WS: RecolorSingleBuilding(gmlId, color)
    WS-->>Consumer: {"type":"ack","gml_id":"..."}
